# Docker build context for Swarm Builder.
#
# Without this file the context includes .pnpm-store (241 MB), .cache
# (135 MB), node_modules, .venv, the uv cache, saved graphs, and .git --
# hundreds of megabytes uploaded to the daemon on every build, for files
# the image never reads.

# --- Version control and editor state ---
.git
.gitignore
.claude

# --- Python ---
.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- Node ---
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.pnpm-store/

# --- Caches ---
.cache/
.uv-cache/
.npm-cache/

# --- Frontend build output: rebuilt in stage 1 from source, so the
# committed copy must not shadow it. ---
web/dist/
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# --- Runtime data: saved graphs and generated projects are mounted at
# runtime, never baked into the image. ---
workspace/
exports/

# --- Research and scratch: the Group 0 spike projects carry their own
# lockfiles and virtualenvs and are not part of the shipped app. ---
spike/

# --- Local planning notes, not application code ---
PLAN-DOCKER.md
GROUP2_PLAN.md
GROUP3_PLAN.md
GROUP6_PLAN.md
TASK_PLAN_inherit_settings.md
